
/* Restore the wording recorded in the local reference snapshots. */
(() => {
  const byPage = {"core-zh":{"八週課程結合經營案例、講師回饋與海外資源":"最強師資陣容 | 8 週精實課程 | 實戰經驗分享 | 海外資源鏈結","第三屆週課由 SparkLabs Taiwan 與 Terry Hsiao 合作。創業者用八週檢視自身公司的經營難題，和實際做過產品、募資及跨境營運的講師討論，也透過校友結識海外夥伴。":"SparkLabs Taiwan 秉持「創業家幫助創業家」的信念，透過鏈結國際資源與系統性教學，培育創業家國際觀與實務創新思維，幫助創業家打下堅實基礎，克服創業障礙並培養應對多變環境能力。第三屆將延續高品質學習體驗承諾，提供豐富實戰經驗分享、案例解析、海外資源鏈結與廣大校友網絡。","在矽谷創辦多家公司，也參與天使投資。":"▍為矽谷連續創業者與天使投資人","第一家行動通訊公司以 4.25 億美元出售。":"▍第一次創業以 4.25 億美元被收購 (行動通訊領域) ","第二次創業出場後，協助公司經由 SPAC 在紐約證交所掛牌。":"▍第二次創業成功被收購並協助公司透過 SPAC 於紐交所上市","擔任大華府玉山科技協會理事長，促進台美科技交流。":"▍現任華府玉山理事長，具有豐富美台、海外企業資源","在喬治華盛頓大學教授創業與創新。":"▍現為美國喬治華盛頓大學創業與創新課程教授","於南加州大學 MBA 課程講授創業與電子商務。":"▍南加州大學 MBA 創業和電子商務課程客座講師","曾領導大中華區團購平台，該業務以新台幣 20 億元被收購。":"▍曾任亞洲團購電商大中華區 CEO，以 20 億新台幣被收購","曾將美國創立的 Muse 夜店品牌帶入中國市場。":"▍美國首次創業之夜店 Muse 拓展至中國並成為國際知名夜店品牌","金融業經歷包括投行董事總經理及 Bear Stearns 基金經理。":"▍曾任投資銀行董事總經理以及貝爾斯登的投資基金經理。","多次創業，並以天使投資人身分支持新創。":"▍數間新創之天使投資人與連續創業家","曾是 EQT Ventures 合夥人，管理規模為 5.66 億歐元的基金。":"▍曾擔任 EQT Ventures Partner，瑞典 EQT AB Group 旗下創投，管理 5.66 億歐元基金","共同創辦 Lithium Technologies，帶領公司成長並出場。":"▍曾經創辦 Lithium Technologies，年度經常性營收破 3 億台幣並成功出場","投入資安領域逾二十年，也曾擔任 OWASP 台灣分會會長。":"▍於資安領域深根超過 20 年，擔任 OWASP 台灣分會會長","與 Cloud Security Alliance 等國際資安組織合作。":"▍兼任 Cloud Security Alliance 等多個國際資安組織主要窗口","ParseMe 的併購是台灣 B2B 軟體新創的代表案例。":"▍台灣 B2B 企業軟體新創最快出場紀錄","課程聯絡信箱（":"還有什麼依然困擾著你的問題？歡迎來信 (","可以遠端上課嗎？":"如果我無法線下實體參與還能購買此課程嗎？","本屆提供線上和實體兩種參與方式。":"可以，課程為線上線下雙軌進行。","學員可以取得錄影嗎？":"請問有課程錄影檔可以複習嗎？","學費未包含回放；報名學員可另外購買錄影供課後複習。":"課程本身不含提供錄影檔，但可供報名課程之學員加購線上錄影檔以作複習。","結業時可取得由 SparkLabs Taiwan 和 Terry Hsiao 認證的上課證明。":"結業當天會提供 SparkLabs Taiwan 與 Terry 老師認證之上課證明。"},"core-en":{"The third cohort pairs founders with experienced operators for eight weeks. Participants work through business cases, exchange feedback with the cohort and build relationships with mentors and alumni overseas.":"Upholding its mission of &quot;Entrepreneurs growing Entrepreneurs,&quot; SparkLabs Taiwan aims to cultivate the international perspective and innovative thinking of entrepreneurs through systematic training and connection to global resources, helping them to establish a solid foundation to adapt to dynamic environments and overcome challenges on their entrepreneurial journey.SparkLabs Taiwan continues its commitment to providing a high-quality learning experience, offering rich practical experience sharing, case analysis, international resources, and a vast alumni network to all the program participants.","Terry grew up in Taiwan and trained at MIT before building businesses in mobile communications.":"▍Terry,  a renowned entrepreneur in the mobile communications industry, grew up in Taiwan and pursued his MBA at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT). He is currently based in Washington, D.C., USA.","Sybase purchased his messaging startup InphoMatch for $425 million.":"▍His first entrepreneurial venture was InphoMatch, an SMS technology service company, which he built and sold to Sybase in Silicon Valley for $425 million. His second venture, Hook Mobile, was later acquired by Kaleyra. Subsequently, he played a pivotal role in facilitating Kaleyra’s listing on the New York Stock Exchange.","His leadership at the Greater Washington, DC chapter of Monte Jade connects technology communities in Taiwan and the US.":"▍Terry also serves as the Chairman of Monte Jade Science &amp; Technology Association for Greater Washington, D.C., endowing him with abundant resources and connections between the U.S., Taiwan, and the international landscape.","Tina teaches entrepreneurship and e-commerce as a guest lecturer at USC.":"▍Guest lecturer at the University of Southern California for entrepreneurship and e-commerce courses in the MBA program","She founded the personalised jewellery company Capsul Jewelry.":"▍Founder of Capsul Jewelry, a customized jewelry e-commerce platformFormer Greater China CEO of a major group-buying e-commerce company, acquired for 2 billion NTD","She took the US nightclub brand Muse into China.":"▍Owned and expanded the Muse nightclub from the U.S. to China, transforming it into an internationally renowned nightlife brand","Her finance background includes a managing director position and fund management at Bear Stearns.":"▍Former Managing Director at an investment bank and an investment fund manager at Bear Stearns","Lyle managed a €566 million fund as a partner at EQT Ventures.":"▍Former EQT Ventures Partner, managing a €566 million fund under the Swedish EQT AB Group","He helped found and scale Lithium Technologies to an exit.":"▍Co-founded Lithium Technologies, a startup with $100+ million ARR and was successful acquired by Vista Equity Partners","Henry has spent over two decades in information security and led the Taiwan chapter of OWASP.":"▍20+ years experience in the cybersecurity industry; serving as the Chairman of OWASP Taiwan Chapter","He works with international security groups including the Cloud Security Alliance.":"▍Key representative for Cloud Security Alliance and various international cybersecurity organizations","His company ParseMe was bought by Gemini Data.":"▍Founder of ParseMe, acquired by Gemini Data Inc., a Silicon-Valley based startup","The acquisition marked an unusually early exit for a Taiwanese enterprise software startup.":"▍Holds the record for the fastest B2B software exit record in Taiwan","Course enquiries (":"What other questions are on your mind? Reach out to us via ","Is remote attendance available?":"Can I register for the course if I am unable to attend in person?","Participants may join remotely or attend in person.":"Yes, the courses are conducted both online and offline.","Can participants review a recorded class?":"Are there video recordings of the course available for review?","Enrolled participants may purchase recordings separately from tuition.":"Participation in the program and the registration fee do not include free video recordings of the courses. However, registered participants can purchase online video recordings with an additional fee for personal review.","SparkLabs Taiwan and Terry Hsiao provide a certificate at the closing session.":"During the closing ceremony of the CORE program, SparkLabs Taiwan and instructor Terry Hsiao will issue a certification of attendance to each participant as proof of course completion."},"gtm-zh":{"三堂 B2B 市場實作課，結合講師回饋及國際人脈":"最強師資陣容 | 3 堂精實課程 | 實務案例演練 | 海外資源鏈","Terry Hsiao 與 Tina Cheng 帶領創辦人用自己的產品練習市場進入策略。學員會帶著目標客戶、銷售通路與定價上的具體問題進教室，並獲得針對自己公司的建議。":"SparkLabs Taiwan 特別聯手矽谷連續創業家 Terry Hsiao &amp; Tina Cheng 分享新創成長至關重要之 Go-to-Market Strategy，協助新創節省十倍摸索時間，並讓學員以「自身公司服務」 (非他人案例) 進行實作練習，給予最直接的回饋。 ","三堂實作課與導師回饋":"3 堂精實課程 | 實務案例演練 | 海外資源鏈結   ","團隊從客戶輪廓出發，規劃產品推出、溝通與銷售通路，再決定用哪些指標追蹤營收與成長。":"帶領團隊建構共同願景和策略方向、目標客群、產品推出計劃、競爭方式、溝通策略、銷售渠道、增長營收方法、績效指標等，擬定可應用之 GTM 策略。","與美國及其他市場的投資人交流。":"▍鏈結美國與國際創投資源機會","在矽谷創辦多家公司，也參與天使投資。":"▍為矽谷連續創業者與天使投資人","第一家行動通訊公司以 4.25 億美元出售。":"▍第一次創業以 4.25 億美元被收購 (行動通訊領域)","第二次創業出場後，協助公司經由 SPAC 在紐約證交所掛牌。":"▍第二次創業成功被收購並協助公司透過 SPAC 於紐交所上市","擔任大華府玉山科技協會理事長，促進台美科技交流。":"▍現任華府玉山理事長，具有豐富美台、海外企業資源","在喬治華盛頓大學教授創業與創新。":"▍現為美國喬治華盛頓大學創業與創新課程教授","於南加州大學 MBA 課程講授創業與電子商務。":"▍南加州大學 MBA 創業和電子商務課程客座講師","曾領導大中華區團購平台，該業務以新台幣 20 億元被收購。":"▍曾任亞洲團購電商大中華區 CEO，以 20 億新台幣被收購","曾將美國創立的 Muse 夜店品牌帶入中國市場。":"▍美國首次創業之夜店 Muse 拓展至中國並成為國際知名夜店品牌","曾在投資銀行與 Bear Stearns 任職，持有 CFA 資格。":"▍曾任投資銀行董事總經理以及貝爾斯登的投資基金經理。擁有特許金融分析師（CFA）資格","2012 年加入 Pieceable Software，該公司隨後被 Facebook 收購。":"▍2012 年 加入 iOS App 開發工具新創 Pieceable Software 不到半年即被 Facebook 收購","課程聯絡信箱（":"還有什麼依然困擾著你的問題？歡迎來信 (","本工作坊重視小組實作，採實體授課。":"為了顧及 workshop 學習品質與互動，僅開放線下參加 ","工作坊會提供錄影嗎？":"2. 請問有課程錄影檔可以複習嗎？","為保護參與公司在課堂分享的資料，工作坊沒有回放。":"因 workshop 課程涉及與會者公司分享更隱私資訊，並無提供錄影檔"},"gtm-en":{"Three working sessions for founders taking a B2B product to market":"Top-notch Faculty | 3 Intensive Courses | Practical Experience Sharing | International Resource Connections","Terry Hsiao and Tina Cheng work with founders on their own products. Each team develops a market-entry plan and receives feedback on the customers and channels it intends to pursue.":"SparkLabs Taiwan partners with serial entrepreneurs from Silicon Valley, Terry Hsiao &amp; Tina Cheng, to share insights into startups Go-to-Market strategy. The workshop aims to assist startups in reducing time spent on trial &amp; error by allowing participants to engage in practical exercises using their own companies’ products and services, with the instructors providing direct feedback. ","Practice and individual feedback over three sessions":"3 Comprehensive Workshops | Practical Case Studies &amp; Exercises| International Resource Connections","Teams identify buyers, decide how to launch and choose sales channels and measures of commercial progress.":"Lead your team to construct a shared vision and strategy direction, define the target audience, product launching plans, competitive approaches, communication strategies, sales channels, revenue growth methods, performance metrics, and formulate applicable GTM strategies.","Meet investors and operators with international experience.":"▍Opportunities to connect with U.S. and International VC Resources","Terry grew up in Taiwan and trained at MIT before building businesses in mobile communications.":"▍Terry, a renowned entrepreneur in the mobile communications industry, grew up in Taiwan and pursued his MBA at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT). He is currently based in Washington, D.C., USA.","Sybase purchased his messaging startup InphoMatch for $425 million.":"▍His first entrepreneurial venture was InphoMatch, an SMS technology service company, which he built and sold to Sybase in Silicon Valley for $425 million. His second venture, Hook Mobile, was later acquired by Kaleyra. Subsequently, he played a pivotal role in facilitating Kaleyra’s listing on the New York Stock Exchange.","His leadership at the Greater Washington, DC chapter of Monte Jade connects technology communities in Taiwan and the US.":"▍Terry also serves as the Chairman of Monte Jade Science &amp; Technology Association for Greater Washington, D.C., endowing him with abundant resources and connections between the U.S., Taiwan, and the international landscape.","Tina teaches entrepreneurship and e-commerce as a guest lecturer at USC.":"▍Guest lecturer at the University of Southern California for entrepreneurship and e-commerce courses in the MBA program","She founded the personalised jewellery company Capsul Jewelry.":"▍Founder of Capsul Jewelry, a customized jewelry e-commerce platformFormer Greater China CEO of a major group-buying e-commerce company, acquired for 2 billion NTD","She took the US nightclub brand Muse into China.":"▍Owned and expanded the Muse nightclub from the U.S. to China, transforming it into an internationally renowned nightlife brand","Her finance background includes a managing director position and fund management at Bear Stearns.":"▍Former Managing Director at an investment bank and an investment fund manager at Bear Stearns","Shanda Games acquired his startup Mochi Media for $80 million in 2010.":"▍Founded Mochi Media, which was acquired by Shanda Games for 80 million USD in 2010","Facebook acquired mobile development startup Pieceable Software in 2012.":"▍Co-founded Pieceable Software, a startup that develops iOS tool-maker, in 2012, and was acquired by Facebook within 6 months of its establishment.","Course enquiries (":"What other questions are on your mind? Reach out to us via ","The workshop is held in person so teams can work through cases together.":"The workshop is only available for offline participation to ensure the quality of interaction and learning.","Are sessions recorded?":"Are video recordings of the workshop available for review?","There is no recording because teams discuss confidential business information.":"Due to the workshop content involving sharing sensitive information from participants’ companies, video recordings will not be provided."},"collaborate-zh":{"企業把真實的營運需求帶進來，新創提供可以測試的產品，雙方從具體專案建立合作。":"企業與新創的合作可以帶來嶄新的商業機會，並在創新生態系中扮演不可或缺的角色。","欲主辦產業加速器或創新競賽的企業。":"欲營運企業垂直加速器或是創新競賽之企業","合作範圍可涵蓋內部創新專案、對外招募及整期加速器的營運。":"SparkLabs Taiwan 擁有營運加速器的豐沛實務經驗與關鍵資源，可以協助企業開展內部或外部的創新專案","從招募到課程共同規劃，再依各隊進度安排個別輔導。":"SparkLabs Taiwan 將協助專案的規劃到執行，並可提供對新創團隊的一對一深入輔導","可透過團隊接觸國際業師、企業夥伴和投資人。":"SparkLabs Taiwan 的國際級導師資源、產業人脈、商業夥伴與投資人網絡，也將為企業所用","高通自 2019 年起在台灣舉辦 QITC。參賽團隊運用行動平台開發 5G、物聯網、機器學習等領域的產品。":"「高通台灣創新競賽」(Qualcomm Innovate in Taiwan Challenge；QITC) : 「高通台灣創新競賽」是由美國高通公司旗下子公司高通技術公司自 2019 年開始舉辦，旨在發掘和培育優秀的新創團隊，讓台灣的創新思維與全球資源整合，進一步推動在地資通訊產業創新動能。此計畫支持台灣新創公司運用高通行動平台在 5G、蜂巢式物聯網、機器學習、智慧城市、多媒體等多元領域開發創新解決方案。","雙方於 2021 年展開合作。2022 年入圍團隊參加產品管理、市場進入和募資等課程，並獲得一對一業師媒合。":"高通與 SparkLabs Taiwan 自 2021 年起開始合作，2022 年雙方持續透過 QITC 深入合作。SparkLabs Taiwan 為 2022 QITC 入圍團隊早期新創創業家量身打造培訓課程及工作坊，課程涵蓋目標設定、產品管理、進入市場策略、國際市場拓張、募資等主題。SparkLabs Taiwan 亦針對各家新創背景和需求提供一對一輔導，連結創業家與海內外業師。","第七屆 DemoDay 與企業創新合作":"SparkLabs Taiwan 新起點！DemoDay 7 宣布更名 助新創走向國際 助企業打破慣性、擁抱創新","希望改善作業流程或推動數位轉型的企業。":"欲尋求創新方案以解決內部挑戰或加速數位轉型之企業","先用約半小時討論需要改善的問題及衡量方式。":"與我們進行 30 分鐘訪談以了解您的公司、目標、需求","確立合作窗口，並以備忘錄記下雙方的工作範圍。":"雙方簽署合作備忘錄 (MoU) 並安排計劃負責窗口","依問題選擇適合試用的新創產品。":"針對貴司需求，媒合新創並評估合作機會與適當性","加速器協調需求與測試，降低跨團隊溝通和導入成本。":"SparkLabs Taiwan 將全力協助企業和新創合作之過程，讓溝通更加順暢，減少數位轉型過程之時間投入、人事成本及營運阻力","共同案例也能讓外界了解企業的創新成果。":"與優秀新創團隊合作的同時，亦促進媒體曝光，建立企業創新、前瞻之形象","一卡通透過訪談整理作業瓶頸，再與 EMILY.RPA 評估流程自動化。雙方將重複工作交給軟體處理，讓人員有時間處理其他服務。":"一卡通總經理鄭凱尹表示：「企業創新過程中非常需要第三方中介角色，協助理解企業面臨的問題，並且提供合適的解決方案。SparkLabs 不僅提供顧問式訪談，了解企業營運情況並挖掘需求後，更推薦了專精於流程自動化服務的新創 EMILY.RPA 提供解決方案，讓公司大幅節省人力，期待未來能與更多新創合作，提供特約機構及消費者更好的服務。」","RPA 以軟體執行重複且規則清楚的工作。":"註：RPA 為由電腦自行操作之軟體機器人，可解決規則化且高重複性工作，為企業節省大量時間並減少人為錯誤。","高雄智慧營運創新轉型論壇":"SparkLabs 高雄智慧營運創新轉型論壇精華影片","讓專業服務進入創業團隊的日常營運":"以您的服務幫助新創團隊成長","希望將工具及服務提供給新創的企業。":"欲觸及新創並為其提供優質服務的企業","先與企業討論服務適合哪些成長階段，再透過現有新創網絡安排介紹。":"SparkLabs Taiwan 已經建立了一個由超過 50 家新創組成的網絡，並與新創圈有緊密連結。SparkLabs Taiwan 將與貴公司進行討論，了解您可以如何幫助新創團隊","工具和服務可在電子報、社群活動及 DemoDay 接觸合適的團隊。":"SparkLabs Taiwan 將協助讓您的產品及服務更為新創團隊所熟知，例如透過社群網路、電子報、DemoDay 以及其他社群活動","Google 與加速器共同舉辦商務和技術交流，讓團隊了解產品出海可使用的服務。":"Google 與 SparkLabs Taiwan 合作，分別就商務以及技術議題舉辦分享會，並介紹其一站式新創解決方案，協助台灣新創邁向國際市場。","請在下方選擇想討論的合作模式，並說明希望解決的問題。":"台灣的新創生態系充滿著無窮可能性，有許多方式可以讓我們一起創造正向影響力。若您有任何合作的想法，歡迎填寫表單與我們聯繫。"},"collaborate-en":{"Companies can test a startup’s product against a real operating need and develop a partnership around the result.":"Collaborations between corporates and startups can contribute to creating abundant new business opportunities for everyone involved in the collaboration process and play an integral role in advancing the innovation ecosystem.","For companies planning an accelerator or an industry innovation challenge.":"Corporates that aspire to fund and run an internal or external accelerator program.","SparkLabs helps design and operate internal projects as well as programs open to outside teams.":"We have extensive know-how in running an accelerator and can become your best partner in executing a Corporate Accelerator Program by providing the resources needed to succeed.","Partners plan selection, curriculum and individual coaching together.":"We work closely with you to design the program and provide hands-on business coaching to the startup teams.","Teams can draw on international mentors, business contacts and investors.":"We are supported by a global network of world-class mentors, tight-knit industry connections, business partners and investors, which are the elements leading to a successful accelerator program.","Qualcomm launched QITC in Taiwan in 2019. Participating founders build on mobile platforms in fields including 5G, IoT and machine learning.":"Qualcomm Innovate in Taiwan Challenge (QITC): QITC is an initiative by Qualcomm, run by its affiliate Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. (QTI), that was started in 2019 to support the development of Taiwan’s ICT ecosystem by identifying and nurturing innovative, new small and medium-sized companies and products. This Qualcomm initiative aims to support the growth of Taiwanese startups in areas such as 5G, cellular connected IoT, machine learning, smart cities, and multimedia with Qualcomm’s mobile platforms and technologies.","The partnership began in 2021. In 2022 finalists received workshops on product, expansion and fundraising as well as individual mentoring.":"Qualcomm and SparkLabs Taiwan started to collaborate in 2021, and the partnership was further deepened in 2022. SparkLabs Taiwan offered training sessions and workshops delivered by a lineup of top-notch speakers tailored for all the QITC 2022 shortlisted teams, covering a wide variety of topics including goal setting, product management, go-to-market, overseas expansion, fundraising, etc. SparkLabs Taiwan also provided the startup teams with customized coaching via one-on-one office hours and connected them with experienced and thoughtful mentors in Taiwan and abroad.","Corporate innovation at DemoDay 7":"SparkLabs Taiwan DemoDay 7: Tech giants Qualcomm and Google joined the startup ecosystem","Find a startup product for an operating problem.":"Bring in a new way to solve your problem","For companies seeking to improve existing processes or introduce digital services.":"Corporates that look for innovative solutions to address internal challenges and facilitate digital transformation.","An initial half-hour discussion establishes the problem and the intended outcome.":"We will kick off the process with a 30-min exploratory call to understand more about your companies, goals, and pain points.","The partners agree on a memorandum and points of contact.":"Following the call, we will sign an MoU and arrange a project contact person for each party.","Teams are selected for their ability to run a relevant trial.":"We will then identify potential startups from within our network and arrange meetings for you to evaluate their suitability for collaboration.","The accelerator helps coordinate trials, clarify requirements and manage implementation.":"We can connect you with startups that offer solutions to address some of your most challenging issues and act as a bridge to ensure smooth communication and project flow.","A shared project can also demonstrate how a company puts innovation into practice.":"You can further strengthen a forward-thinking and innovative brand image through media exposures.","iPASS identified repetitive office tasks through interviews and explored robotic process automation with EMILY.RPA to free up staff time.":"“During corporates innovation process, there’s a strong need to rely on third party to mediate and coordinate. SparkLabs Taiwan is a great partner in providing consulting interview, matching suitable startup - EMILY.RPA after understanding iPASS overal business. It’s a big help for iPASS and we improve our operation efficiency and reduce cost. We expect there will have more opportunities to collaborate with SparkLabs.”","For service providers that want to work with founders.":"Corporates that would like to approach and acquire startup companies as customers.","Start by identifying the teams and stages of growth best suited to the product.":"We have established a startup ecosystem composed of 50+ companies from our accelerator portfolio and a broader startup network with which we are closely connected.","Reach founders through introductions, events, newsletters and the DemoDay network.":"We can work together to create a tailored plan to introduce your product or service to our network through various potential channels, including social media, EDM, DemoDay, and other community events.","Google and SparkLabs ran technical and business sessions introducing services for teams entering international markets.":"Google collaborated with SparkLabs Taiwan to provide sharing sessions and one-stop services covering both business and technology aspects to support Taiwanese startups to grow and expand internationally.","Select a partnership type and outline the project you would like to discuss.":"The overall innovative energy in Taiwan is endless, and there are many ways we can work together to create positive changes. Please fill out the form to contact us about possible collaborations."},"invest-zh":{"基金聚焦早期公司，主要涵蓋種子輪前至 A 輪。":"我們加速並投資早期新創團隊，主要階段為種子輪前到 A 輪。","團隊陪伴台灣創辦人出海，也協助海外公司進入亞洲市場。":"我們協助台灣創業家走向國際，也協助國際創業家在亞洲落地。","每年接觸逾 800 家公司，當中約 20 家獲投資及加速支持。":"我們一年接觸 800 家以上的新創，從中加速並投資約 20 家新創。","核心成員具有創業、營運以及跨國企業的經驗。":"我們的核心成員都同時具備「在新創工作或實際創業」以及「在跨國公司工作」的實務經驗。","對基金或投資組合有興趣，可在下方選擇投資方向並填寫聯繫資料。":"如果您有意投資 SparkLabs Taiwan 的創投基金，或是有意投資我們加速的新創團隊，歡迎填寫表單與我們聯繫。","投資人身分（請選一項）*":"您所屬的投資人類型 (請選擇最能描述您的選項)*","曾投資創投基金嗎？*":"您過去曾經投資過任何創投基金嗎？*","曾直接投資新創公司嗎？*":"您過去曾經投資過任何新創公司嗎？*"},"invest-en":{"The fund backs early-stage businesses, generally from pre-seed to Series A.":"We invest in early-stage startups, mainly participating in Pre-Seed to Series-A rounds.","The team works with Taiwanese founders abroad and overseas founders entering Asian markets.":"We grow with Taiwanese founders targeting global expansion and foreign founders targeting Asia Markets.","About 20 startups receive funding and acceleration from over 800 opportunities reviewed each year.":"We source 800+ deals and finance around 20 startups a year.","The core team combines startup operating experience with work in multinational businesses.":"All of our core members are equipped with practical experience in multinational companies and have played critical roles in startups.","SparkLabs Taiwan was ParseMe’s first institutional backer.":"SparkLabs Taiwan was the first institutional investor of ParseMe","SparkLabs Taiwan was Just Kitchen’s first institutional backer.":"SparkLabs Taiwan was the first institutional investor of Just Kitchen","Within two years of its founding, Just Kitchen listed in Canada, Germany and the United States in 2021.":"Went public in Canada, Germany, and the U.S. in 2021","Choose an investment interest below to enquire about the fund or individual companies.":"If you want to invest in SparkLabs Taiwan’s Fund or in our portfolio companies, please fill out the form to contact us.","Previous venture fund investments":"Have you invested in any VC funds in the past?  *","Previous direct startup investments":"Have you invested in any startups in the past?  *"},"demoday-zh":{"第十屆 DemoDay 在台北舉行。創辦人向受邀的投資人與企業主管展示產品，國際講者則帶來產業觀察，讓與會者可以直接討論合作或投資。":"SparkLabs Taiwan DemoDay  是一場創業家的盛典，互相激盪劃時代概念、分享新創理念以及對未來的想像。這次 SparkLabs Taiwan DemoDay 10 將獨家開放給投資人和企業高層的活動，並邀請目前最受矚目的國際講者分享行業趨勢和前瞻性的見解，為參與的貴賓提供豐富的知識饗宴！","台北市；主辦單位向獲邀者提供地址。":"台灣台北市（詳細地址將在審核通過後發信告知）"},"demoday-en":{"The eleventh DemoDay spotlights agentic AI and physical AI.":"SparkLabs Taiwan DemoDay is a celebration of the entrepreneurial journey—and this year, it shines a spotlight on Agent AI &amp; Physical AI. ","Startup teams present their products to an invited audience of investors and corporate decision-makers.":"This exclusive event brings together investors and corporate leaders, providing a unique opportunity to discover high-potential startups and forge meaningful connections. ","International speakers and founders discuss emerging applications, investment opportunities and the practical work of taking AI products to market.":"With international speakers sharing insights on emerging trends and the evolving AI landscape, DemoDay 11 promises to be a dynamic platform for inspiration, learning, and investment exploration."},"career-en":{"Work with founders taking Taiwanese technology to international markets":"Join us if you are passionate about helping Taiwanese startups go global!","The accelerator is a small team with projects that change as its portfolio grows.":"We&#x27;re looking for talented individuals that have the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth, and small company. ","Compensation includes a salary and performance bonuses.":"Not only is the work at SparkLabs fun, exciting, and challenging, but we offer a competitive salary and bonuses.","Work alongside technology founders in our":"to work directly with many of Taiwan&#x27;s top tech startups and high-caliber entrepreneurs. Check out our ","See how companies operate across different industries.":"to learn about numerous industries and see various business models.","Propose projects and take responsibility for delivery.":"freedom to bring new ideas and lead entire projects.","Team members shape both the accelerator’s work and the experience of each founder admitted to a program.":"SparkLabs Taiwan is a startup and we function just like any other startups do. Each and one of us can make a positive impact not only on our own team, but also our portfolio companies at the same time by taking ownership of yourself, your work, and your goals. When you feel there&#x27;s something you/we can do to benefit our SparkLabs community, there&#x27;s no need to hesitate and wait for permission!","Colleagues share responsibilities and can develop projects that draw on their strengths.":"We are a small and close-knit team, and all of our team members wear multiple hats at the same time. We encourage our team to find or even create opportunities so they can utilize their skills to the greatest extent. Think forward, anticipate the need of the team, take initiative to make a plan and execute the tasks.","The team studies new business models and technologies before deciding how to support them.":"The startup scene is constantly evolving and changing, and there are often new ideas, trends, hypes, and buzzwords rolling out. In order for us to make the best judgement and coach founders better, we need to be continuously searching for new sources of knowledge, improving our skills, and absorbing new market information.","Work ranges from managing entire programs to coordinating founders, mentors and partners.":"At SparkLabs Taiwan, we offer a great opportunity for our team members to learn quickly about startups and startup growth, to lead and manage entire projects from 0 to 1, and to level up in their career.","We look for the following strengths:":"Our work culture is fun and challenging, and we expect our team members to have:","A commitment to helping founders enter new markets.":"Passion and commitment to SparkLabs Taiwan&#x27;s mission of helping startup founders go global.","Initiative and the ability to learn quickly.":"Track record of being a self-starter, quick learner, and fast thinker.","Independent ownership from planning through delivery.":"Ability to work independently, take ownership of entire projects, and execute at a high level with minimal guidance.","Careful planning and prioritisation across overlapping deadlines.":"Exceptional project management skills, attention to detail, and ability to multitask in order to balance multiple projects and deadlines to meet objectives.","Written and spoken Mandarin and English.":"Good verbal and written communication skills in Chinese and English.","Explore the current roles below.":"Looking for a challenging but fun work environment? SparkLabs is the right place for you!",". Include the role and your name in the subject line.":". With the email subject line: [Apply] SparkLabs Taiwan Team - (Role you want to apply) - (Your Name)","Our finance team is hiring a":"SparkLabs Taiwan is at the forefront of the AI and deep tech revolution. We are looking for a strategic and data-driven ","to manage fund operations and use financial analysis to support founders raising capital.":"to join our team and fuel the growth of our ecosystem. This is not just a traditional finance role; it is an opportunity to become a strategic architect of capital, using financial insights to power our fund’s growth and champion the next generation of world-changing AI startups through their fundraising journeys. ","The marketing lead plans editorial work, measures campaign results and develops the brand’s coverage of AI startups.":"We are looking for a visionary and results-driven Marketing Manager to join our team and shape the future of our brand. This is not just a marketing role; it&#x27;s an opportunity to become a key voice in the tech ecosystem, build a powerful content engine, and champion the next generation of world-changing AI startups. ","This role builds relationships between public agencies and the AI startup community.":"We are looking for a Program Manager with a strong interest in startup public affairs in the AI era. We are seeking a visionary and results-driven individual who is passionate about the startup ecosystem and the AI revolution to join our growing team!","The program manager coordinates public-sector projects and represents the accelerator in policy discussions.":"This is an exciting, fast-paced role. You will be the bridge between the public sector and SparkLabs Taiwan, shaping the future of public affairs for AI startups. We’re looking for someone who isn’t afraid of rolling up their sleeves, is willing to take the initiative, and works well under pressure. If you find comfort working in a dynamic and hands-on role, we would love to meet you!","The operations team is hiring an":"We are looking for a detail-oriented and resourceful ","to coordinate budgets, office services, HR processes and accelerator events.":" to oversee the daily management of SparkLabs Taiwan’s office and accelerator operations. This role will ensure smooth office administration, support HR processes, manage operational expenditures, and assist leadership with program/company P&amp;L oversight.","Help early-stage founders build companies across Asia.":"Join us to empower the next generation of startups across Asia.","to deliver accelerator projects, support founders and manage business partnerships.":" who thrives on building, problem-solving, and creating impact with founders. If you have experience in business development, product management, project management, or marketing, and are eager to tap into the venture ecosystem, this role offers the perfect bridge between startup execution and venture acceleration."},"career-zh":{"Work with founders taking Taiwanese technology to international markets":"Join us if you are passionate about helping Taiwanese startups go global!","The accelerator is a small team with projects that change as its portfolio grows.":"We&#x27;re looking for talented individuals that have the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth, and small company. ","Compensation includes a salary and performance bonuses.":"Not only is the work at SparkLabs fun, exciting, and challenging, but we offer a competitive salary and bonuses.","Work alongside technology founders in our":"to work directly with many of Taiwan&#x27;s top tech startups and high-caliber entrepreneurs. Check out our ","See how companies operate across different industries.":"to learn about numerous industries and see various business models.","Propose projects and take responsibility for delivery.":"freedom to bring new ideas and lead entire projects.","Team members shape both the accelerator’s work and the experience of each founder admitted to a program.":"SparkLabs Taiwan is a startup and we function just like any other startups do. Each and one of us can make a positive impact not only on our own team, but also our portfolio companies at the same time by taking ownership of yourself, your work, and your goals. When you feel there&#x27;s something you/we can do to benefit our SparkLabs community, there&#x27;s no need to hesitate and wait for permission!","Colleagues share responsibilities and can develop projects that draw on their strengths.":"We are a small and close-knit team, and all of our team members wear multiple hats at the same time. We encourage our team to find or even create opportunities so they can utilize their skills to the greatest extent. Think forward, anticipate the need of the team, take initiative to make a plan and execute the tasks.","The team studies new business models and technologies before deciding how to support them.":"The startup scene is constantly evolving and changing, and there are often new ideas, trends, hypes, and buzzwords rolling out. In order for us to make the best judgement and coach founders better, we need to be continuously searching for new sources of knowledge, improving our skills, and absorbing new market information.","Work ranges from managing entire programs to coordinating founders, mentors and partners.":"At SparkLabs Taiwan, we offer a great opportunity for our team members to learn quickly about startups and startup growth, to lead and manage entire projects from 0 to 1, and to level up in their career.","We look for the following strengths:":"Our work culture is fun and challenging, and we expect our team members to have:","A commitment to helping founders enter new markets.":"Passion and commitment to SparkLabs Taiwan&#x27;s mission of helping startup founders go global.","Initiative and the ability to learn quickly.":"Track record of being a self-starter, quick learner, and fast thinker.","Independent ownership from planning through delivery.":"Ability to work independently, take ownership of entire projects, and execute at a high level with minimal guidance.","Careful planning and prioritisation across overlapping deadlines.":"Exceptional project management skills, attention to detail, and ability to multitask in order to balance multiple projects and deadlines to meet objectives.","Written and spoken Mandarin and English.":"Good verbal and written communication skills in Chinese and English.","Explore the current roles below.":"Looking for a challenging but fun work environment? SparkLabs is the right place for you!",". Include the role and your name in the subject line.":". With the email subject line: [Apply] SparkLabs Taiwan Team - (Role you want to apply) - (Your Name)","Our finance team is hiring a":"SparkLabs Taiwan is at the forefront of the AI and deep tech revolution. We are looking for a strategic and data-driven ","to manage fund operations and use financial analysis to support founders raising capital.":"to join our team and fuel the growth of our ecosystem. This is not just a traditional finance role; it is an opportunity to become a strategic architect of capital, using financial insights to power our fund’s growth and champion the next generation of world-changing AI startups through their fundraising journeys. ","The marketing lead plans editorial work, measures campaign results and develops the brand’s coverage of AI startups.":"We are looking for a visionary and results-driven Marketing Manager to join our team and shape the future of our brand. This is not just a marketing role; it&#x27;s an opportunity to become a key voice in the tech ecosystem, build a powerful content engine, and champion the next generation of world-changing AI startups. ","This role builds relationships between public agencies and the AI startup community.":"We are looking for a Program Manager with a strong interest in startup public affairs in the AI era. We are seeking a visionary and results-driven individual who is passionate about the startup ecosystem and the AI revolution to join our growing team!","The program manager coordinates public-sector projects and represents the accelerator in policy discussions.":"This is an exciting, fast-paced role. You will be the bridge between the public sector and SparkLabs Taiwan, shaping the future of public affairs for AI startups. We’re looking for someone who isn’t afraid of rolling up their sleeves, is willing to take the initiative, and works well under pressure. If you find comfort working in a dynamic and hands-on role, we would love to meet you!","The operations team is hiring an":"We are looking for a detail-oriented and resourceful ","to coordinate budgets, office services, HR processes and accelerator events.":" to oversee the daily management of SparkLabs Taiwan’s office and accelerator operations. This role will ensure smooth office administration, support HR processes, manage operational expenditures, and assist leadership with program/company P&amp;L oversight.","Help early-stage founders build companies across Asia.":"Join us to empower the next generation of startups across Asia.","to deliver accelerator projects, support founders and manage business partnerships.":" who thrives on building, problem-solving, and creating impact with founders. If you have experience in business development, product management, project management, or marketing, and are eager to tap into the venture ecosystem, this role offers the perfect bridge between startup execution and venture acceleration."}};
  const layouts = window.EDITION.referenceLayouts;
  for (const [page, wording] of Object.entries(byPage)) {
    layouts[page] = layouts[page].replace(/>([^<]+)(?=<)/g, (match, text) =>
      Object.hasOwn(wording, text) ? '>' + wording[text] : match
    );
  }
})();
